      "name": "OTR FLUX Smoke + SageAttention",
      "description": "Sister workflow to otr_flux_smoke.json. Same path but with a PathchSageAttentionKJ node patched between CheckpointLoaderSimple(1) MODEL output and KSampler(5) model input. Backend: sageattn_qk_int8_pv_fp16_cuda. Tests whether SageAttention works with the STANDARD KSampler call shape on FLUX-dev-fp8 / Blackwell sm_120. If this works (it should), it confirms BUG-LOCAL-070 is specifically about BatchFluxRender's custom batched-conditioning fast-batch path, not SageAttention vs FLUX in general. Expected: ~22-26s sampling vs the baseline ~26s without Sage (5-15% gain at this resolution).",
